{"body": [{"y0": 65.4, "x0": 67.3, "x1": 250.9, "text": "Ut loquerer técum veni tecumque sederem,"}, {"y0": 83.8, "x0": 41.9, "x1": 250.5, "text": "65 né tibi nón notus quem facis esset amor."}, {"y0": 102.3, "x0": 66.9, "x1": 268.2, "text": "Tü cursüs spectas, ego té — spectemus uterque"}, {"y0": 120.3, "x0": 77.5, "x1": 282.4, "text": "quod iuvat, atque oculos pàáscat uterque suos!\""}, {"y0": 138.3, "x0": 66.6, "x1": 310.3, "text": "Cornelius: ^Ego memorià teneó versüs Ovidii de pu-"}, {"y0": 156.5, "x0": 55.4, "x1": 310.3, "text": "ellà quae poetam industrium prohibebat bellum 'Troia-"}, {"y0": 174.9, "x0": 41.0, "x1": 215.4, "text": "70 num canere et fatum régis Priami:"}, {"y0": 193.2, "x0": 66.0, "x1": 269.4, "text": "Saepe meae \"Tandem\" dixi \"discede!\" puellae"}, {"y0": 211.6, "x0": 76.8, "x1": 236.8, "text": "— in gremio sedit protinus illa meo!"}, {"y0": 229.4, "x0": 65.8, "x1": 268.2, "text": "Saepe Pudet\" dixi. Lacrimis vix illa retentis"}, {"y0": 247.8, "x0": 77.9, "x1": 276.8, "text": "\"Me miseram! Iam te\" dixit \"*amàre pudet?\""}, {"y0": 266.1, "x0": 39.9, "x1": 255.2, "text": "75  Implicuitque suós circum mea colla lacertos"}, {"y0": 284.3, "x0": 77.4, "x1": 252.3, "text": "et, quae mé perdunt, oscula mille dedit!"}, {"y0": 302.3, "x0": 66.9, "x1": 276.4, "text": "Vincor, et ingenium sümptis revocatur ab armis,"}, {"y0": 320.5, "x0": 77.0, "x1": 246.9, "text": "resque domi gestás et mea bella cano.\""}, {"y0": 338.9, "x0": 66.6, "x1": 310.1, "text": "Fabia: \"Iste poeta viris solis placet. Mé véró magis"}, {"y0": 357.2, "x0": 39.7, "x1": 310.1, "text": "80 iuvant carmina bella quae Catullus scripsit ad Lesbiam"}, {"y0": 375.2, "x0": 55.0, "x1": 308.8, "text": "amicam. Si tibi libet, Iüli, recità nobis e libro Catulli.\""}, {"y0": 393.2, "x0": 66.2, "x1": 310.1, "text": "*Libenter faciam\" inquit Iülius, \"sed iam nimis ob-"}, {"y0": 411.8, "x0": 55.2, "x1": 309.9, "text": "scürum est hoc triclinium; in tenebris legere nón pos-"}, {"y0": 430.1, "x0": 55.2, "x1": 208.6, "text": "sum. Lucernàs accendite, servi!\""}, {"y0": 447.4, "x0": 39.6, "x1": 309.9, "text": "85 . Lucernis accénsis, Iülius librum Catulli proferri iu-"}, {"y0": 466.3, "x0": 55.2, "x1": 309.9, "text": "bet, tum \"Incipiam\" inquit \"à carmine dé morte passe-"}, {"y0": 484.5, "x0": 55.0, "x1": 225.9, "text": "ris quem Lesbia in deliciis habuerat:"}, {"y0": 502.8, "x0": 65.7, "x1": 205.0, "text": "Lügéte, 0 Veneres Cupidinesque"}, {"y0": 521.2, "x0": 65.8, "x1": 234.1, "text": "et quantum est hominum venustiórum!"}, {"y0": 538.7, "x0": 39.2, "x1": 209.7, "text": "90 — Passer mortuus est meae puellae,"}], "margin": [{"y0": 76.2, "x0": 324.5, "x1": 392.2, "text": "nón notus : ignótus"}, {"y0": 85.4, "x0": 324.3, "x1": 408.5, "text": "amor quem facis (: exci-"}, {"y0": 94.4, "x0": 328.6, "x1": 340.7, "text": "tàs)"}, {"y0": 122.0, "x0": 323.9, "x1": 388.4, "text": "páscere : delectáre"}, {"y0": 139.6, "x0": 323.9, "x1": 408.9, "text": "[Ovidius: Amóres 11.18.]"}, {"y0": 149.1, "x0": 324.1, "x1": 412.3, "text": "bellum canere — dé belló"}, {"y0": 158.7, "x0": 328.3, "x1": 403.1, "text": "c. (: carmen scribere)"}, {"y0": 167.3, "x0": 323.9, "x1": 410.5, "text": "fatum-iz — quod necesse"}, {"y0": 176.9, "x0": 328.3, "x1": 391.3, "text": "est accidere, mors"}, {"y0": 186.4, "x0": 323.6, "x1": 385.5, "text": "meae puellae dixi"}, {"y0": 195.8, "x0": 323.8, "x1": 403.7, "text": "tandem (-4- imp) — age!"}, {"y0": 204.8, "x0": 322.7, "x1": 411.6, "text": "gremium -i 7 — genua se-"}, {"y0": 213.8, "x0": 327.2, "x1": 404.4, "text": "dentis; in gremio meó"}, {"y0": 222.9, "x0": 323.6, "x1": 372.4, "text": "sedere sedisse"}, {"y0": 231.9, "x0": 323.6, "x1": 355.3, "text": "mé pudet"}, {"y0": 241.1, "x0": 323.8, "x1": 403.3, "text": "retinere -uisse -tentum"}, {"y0": 269.0, "x0": 323.2, "x1": 367.7, "text": "suós lacertos"}, {"y0": 277.7, "x0": 323.2, "x1": 369.8, "text": "colla : collum"}, {"y0": 286.8, "x0": 323.2, "x1": 358.1, "text": "mihi dedit"}, {"